deb":"device plugin","s278bec403ed17e":" 没有的功能吗？带着疑问，我们开始查看 hami-device-plugin-nvidia 源码。","s6d38dba5140505":"2.程序入口","se56340620f9a3f":"基于 HAMi v2.3.13 版本","s313068b16b0319":"HAMi 首先支持的是 NVIDIA GPU，单独实现了一个 device plugin nvidia。","sa829ac8aa920e6":"启动文件在 ","s176d2a4374811b":"cmd/device-plugin/nvidia","s2f939ffac28d09":"核心实在在 ","s747ff31b13f649":"pkg/device-plugin/nvidiadevice","sc542311ec8ce86":"默认大家都对 k8s 的 device plugin 机制比较熟悉了，因此这里只分析核心代码逻辑，不然篇幅就太长了。","s0db5d5010b707b":"对于一个 device plugin 我们一般关注以下 3 个方法：","sf769eba6557ef1":"Register：将插件注册到 Kubelet 的，参数 ResourceName 比较重要","sf00869835e57ca":"ListAndWatch：device plugin 是怎么感知 GPU 并上报的","s730f6548c7a973":"Allocate：device plugin 是如何将 GPU 分配给 Pod 的","s2eb4e7d495f234":"启动命令在","s8858100ce5b755":"/cmd/device-plugin/nvidia","sa89921257e5458":"，用的是 ","s7363368b940840":"github.com/urfave/cli/v2","s37b0a9bfd141a9":"构建的一个命令行工具。","sf63827270b1643":"func","s0d6e4079e36703":"main","s2e38e77b22c314":"()","s30563a6c7cbf2e":" {\n ","sc86872dc97dd35":"var","s1fac88cb2b66e0":" configFile ","s473287f8298dba":"string","se278f6600c6ec1":"\n\n c := cli.NewApp()\n c.Name = ","sc01f338dcb14d3":"\"NVIDIA Device Plugin\"","s9938970cc2adba":"\n c.Usage = ","sce1e238a8d5389":"\"NVIDIA device plugin for Kubernetes\"","s57d4d33ae35612":"\n c.Version = info.GetVersionString()\n c.Action = ","sab6f1974b992bc":"(ctx *cli.Context)","sca00fccfb40898":"error","se29573037c26ba":" {\n  ","s7187f0675eb382":"return","s1249cde5e7728b":" start(ctx, c.Flags)\n }\n\n c.Flags = []cli.Flag{\n  &cli.StringFlag{\n   Name:    ","s5a33e24dde8f0d":"\"mig-strategy\"","sdad6afc1c6e70c":",\n   Value:   spec.MigStrategyNone,\n   Usage:   ","s76090901849026":"\"the desired strategy for exposing MIG devices on GPUs that support it:\\n\\t\\t[none | single | mixed]\"","s3e88b863131cea":",\n   EnvVars: []","s021fb596db81e6":"{","s96ed656ada769a":"\"MIG_STRATEGY\"","s69fc24eca63baa":"},\n  },\n  &cli.BoolFlag{\n   Name:    ","sf5765026785e59":"\"fail-on-init-error\"","sa95f60a3